ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'all', 'Info': 'Resets all BGP connections.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'as-number', 'Info': 'Resets BGP connections with peers in ASs expressed in dotted notation.\nThe value is in the format of x.y, where x and y are integers that range from 1 to 65535 and from 0 to 65535, respectively.'}
