## User question:
How to disable route reflection among clients connected to a Huawei NE40E router's BGP VPNv6 RR when they are fully meshed?
---
## Proposed answer:
system-view
bgp [AS_NUMBER]
ipv6-family vpnv6
undo reflect between-clients
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
reflect between-clients
undo reflect between-clients
FuncDef:
The reflect between-clients command enables route reflection among clients through the RR.
